{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">坊間流傳使用生鐵鑊炒菜能為身體額外增加鐵質，究竟這種說法是否真確？《最強生命線》請來專家解構「鐵質」，帶大家深入了解其來源和功用！</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">鐵質是紅血球中血紅素的必要成分，負責幫助細胞運送氧氣和營養；它同時維持新陳代謝、修復及複製 DNA、提供能量，並在免疫系統中扮演不可或缺的角色。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">男士建議攝取量：每日 12 毫克。</p></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">有趣發現：在糧食貧乏的國家，曾有研究發現透過在烹煮時放入鐵塊，可有效增加食物中的含鐵量，經醫學證實能減少居民的貧血情況。現時歐美多國亦有要求在特定食品（如麵包、粟米片）中添加微量營養素。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>迷思破解：生鐵鑊炒菜真能補鐵？</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">坊間流傳使用生鐵鑊炒菜能額外增加鐵質。專家指出，在烹調與加熱的過程中，生鐵器具確實會釋放微量鐵質至食物中，人體進食後亦能吸收到一部分。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">市民須小心使用生鐵廚具。若長期使用這類餐具烹調鹽分或酸性較高的食物，容易導致鑊身生銹。生銹的鐵具因氧化變質，不僅不再是人體所需的鐵質，更容易滋生細菌，使用時務必留意。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"05ab05c2-8f68-48dd-acd7-80c511a0952c.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026KW78bFjmE51783936210.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"05ab05c2-8f68-48dd-acd7-80c511a0952c.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">日常從食物吸收的鐵質主要分為兩大類：</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li></li></ol><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">以每 100 克計算，紅肉類約提供 2.6 毫克鐵質；而甲殼類海鮮的鐵質含量更為豐富，每 100 克可提供高達 27.9 毫克。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">註冊營養師梁曦允特別提醒，含多酚類的茶、咖啡，以及含鈣質的食物會阻礙鐵質吸收，應盡量避免與高鐵食物同時食用。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e4165bd8-a0fe-4afb-ad3f-2c9af9ce552b.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026KxU1GV34iV1783936204.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e4165bd8-a0fe-4afb-ad3f-2c9af9ce552b.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">若想攝取足夠鐵質，不妨參考以下這款高鐵韓式飯捲。註冊營養師梁曦允建議將白飯「升級」，由於韓式珍珠米升糖指數較高，加入「藜麥」不僅能增加飽肚感，亦能提供豐富蛋白質及膳食纖維。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>製作步驟</strong>：</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">素食小貼士：素食者可選用豆乾、豆腐，或紅豆、鷹嘴豆、紅腰豆等乾豆類代替牛肉，同樣是良好的鐵質來源。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-14T06:19:25.788831+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":701,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}